      "height": 276,
      "text": "Grounded draft answer (example)\nProceed conditionally: open at 41 Mill Lane once the rent-free period is confirmed in writing.\n\nBasis:\n1. Fit-out reaches break-even in month 14 at 190 orders/day (Market brief, p.1).\n2. Summer dip and rent-free terms need written confirmation before signing (Whiteboard & brief, p.3).\n\nReplace this with your own view, or ask AI in the right sidebar.",
